          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua hano abhabhisa bha Yuta na Bhenchamini bhaaigurë iga, abhantö bhaara bhaaruurë köng'aanyi nköhagaacha bharë bhöhëa ëhekaru yö ÖMÖNENE, Ënooköë wa Isiraeri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.24+2KI.17.25+2KI.17.26+2KI.17.27+2KI.17.28+2KI.17.29+2KI.17.30+2KI.17.31+2KI.17.32+2KI.17.33+2KI.17.34+2KI.17.35+2KI.17.36+2KI.17.37+2KI.17.38+2KI.17.39+2KI.17.40+2KI.17.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Gam 17:24-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbaagërëëyë Serubhabheri na abhatangati bhi ichika na kömöteebhia iga, “Torakögeya tögootane köbhöhagaachi bhoë ëhekaru. Bhaitö nkebhainyu, ngösengera törë Ënooköë weinyu, na ntooya töramuruusia ikimuenso gukurua karai gönkaaga ya Esari-hatoni, ömögambi wa Asuru öno atörentërë hano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si Serubhaabheri, Yesua na abhatangati bhandë bhi ibhiaro bhia Isiraeri bhakabhateebhia iga, “Bhaitö titugutuna bhutuurria bhörë bhonsui kurua harë bhainyu köhagaacha ëhekaru yë Ënooköë weitö hai. Bhaitö abhiene ntörahagachëre ÖMÖNENE, Ënooköë wa Isiraeri, kehaara Ömögambi Koresi wa Bhuachemi aruusiri ëngamba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo, abhantö bhano waanyoorrë bhamenyërë ahasë hayö bhagatanga köbhaita ömooyo na köbhobhohirria korri bhange kögendërria na öbhöhagaachi keebhörë waanyoorrë bhaaseemiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guiki mbaasooyërë abhahobhisa bhasirikare ya Asuru korri bhakërane na Abhayahuti. Mbaagendërrëëyi gökora ke hayö gönkaaga yonsui yö öbhögambi bhö ömögambi Koresi, kuhika ënkaaga yö öbhögambi bhö ömögambi Tario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Öbhökërani köbhöhagaachi bho Yerusaremu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
